<main class="ttv147">
<section class="tt-hero"><div class="wrap tt-hero-grid"><div><div class="tt-eyebrow">TIMETRACK FOR ULTIMA SERIES</div><h1><span>Every Employee Interaction</span><span>Captured. Guided. Controlled.</span></h1><p class="tt-hero-sub">Workforce Data Collection at the Point of Interaction.</p><p class="tt-hero-copy">TimeTrack transforms Ultima Series devices into workforce data collection points for time, labor, self-service and configured workforce controls.</p><div class="tt-pills"><span class="tt-pill time">TIME</span><span class="tt-pill labor">LABOR</span><span class="tt-pill self">SELF-SERVICE</span><span class="tt-pill control">CONTROLS</span></div><div class="tt-btns"><a class="tt-btn primary" href="#experience">Explore TimeTrack â†’</a><a class="tt-btn ghost" href="contact.html">Talk to Our Team</a></div></div><div class="device-showcase actual-device" aria-label="TimeTrack on an Ultima Series device"><div class="device-glow"></div><img class="hero-ultima" src="assets/ultima-7.png" alt="Ultima 7 running TimeTrack"/><div class="powered hero-powered">Powered by TimeTrack</div></div></div></section>
<section class="tt-section experience-section" id="experience"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-center"><div class="tt-eyebrow">ONE EXPERIENCE</div><h2>Everything Employees Need, One Consistent<br/>Experience</h2><p>TimeTrack brings essential workforce interactions together at the point where workforce data begins.</p></div><div class="experience-powered-art"><img src="assets/powered by Time track.jpg" alt="Ultima Series powered by TimeTrack, supporting time, labor, self-service and workforce controls"/></div><div class="experience-map">
<div class="exp-card exp-time"><div class="exp-title">TIME</div><ul><li>Clock In / Out</li><li>Meals &amp; Breaks</li><li>Attendance Events</li><li>Department Transfer</li></ul></div>
<div class="exp-card exp-labor"><div class="exp-title">LABOR</div><ul><li>Position &amp; Jobs</li><li>Cost Centers</li><li>Project Numbers</li><li>Worktags</li></ul></div>
<div class="experience-family"><img src="assets/ultima-family-all-four-v45.png" alt="Ultima Series powered by TimeTrack"/><div class="powered">Powered by TimeTrack</div></div>
<div class="exp-card exp-self"><div class="exp-title">SELF-SERVICE</div><ul><li>Schedules</li><li>Accrual Balances</li><li>Time Off</li><li>Employee Access</li></ul></div>
<div class="exp-card exp-control"><div class="exp-title">WORKFORCE CONTROLS</div><ul><li>Attestations</li><li>Validations</li><li>Lockouts</li><li>Approvals</li></ul></div>
</div><div class="experience-line"><strong>One Device Family.</strong> <span>â€¢</span> <strong>One Application.</strong> <span>â€¢</span> Every Essential Workforce Interaction.</div></div></section>
<section class="tt-section mist" id="timestamp"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-center"><div class="tt-eyebrow">WORKFORCE DATA COLLECTION</div><h2>More Than a Timestamp.</h2><p>TimeTrack captures the context that gives each workforce transaction meaning.</p></div><div class="question-grid"><article class="question qtime"><small>TIME</small><h3>When did the employee work?</h3></article><article class="question qlabor"><small>LABOR</small><h3>What work was performed?</h3></article><article class="question qself"><small>SELF-SERVICE</small><h3>What information is needed?</h3></article><article class="question qcontrol"><small>CONTROLS</small><h3>What requirements should be applied?</h3></article></div><div class="bottom-statement">Better workforce data begins at the employee interaction.</div></div></section>
<section class="tt-section flexibility-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-center"><div class="tt-eyebrow">WORKFORCE FLEXIBILITY</div><h2>Adapt the Workflow,<br/>Not the Workforce</h2><p>A consistent application foundation, configured around workforce requirements.</p></div><div class="flex-stage"><article class="flex-card"><div class="label">STANDARD FOUNDATION</div><h3>Built to stay consistent</h3><div class="clean-list"><div class="clean-item">Attendance</div><div class="clean-item">Labor</div><div class="clean-item">Self-Service</div><div class="clean-item">Controls</div></div></article><div class="flex-plus">+</div><article class="flex-card dark"><div class="label">CONFIGURE FOR YOUR ENVIRONMENT</div><h3>Designed to fit the workforce.</h3><div class="clean-list"><div class="clean-item">Workforce Policies</div><div class="clean-item">Labor Structures</div><div class="clean-item">Employee Workflows</div><div class="clean-item">Integrations</div></div></article></div><div class="flex-caption"><strong>Standardize the foundation.</strong> Configure the interaction around how your workforce operates.</div></div></section>
<section class="tt-section mist"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-center"><div class="tt-eyebrow">WORKFORCE ARCHITECTURE</div><h2>One Workforce Application.<br/>Multiple Workforce Environments.</h2><p>TimeTrack stays focused on the employee interaction while the connected architecture fits the workforce platform.</p></div><div class="arch-grid"><article class="arch-card"><h3>Workday</h3><div class="arch-tag">Time &amp; Labor Data Collection. Built for Workday.</div><div class="arch-flow"><span class="flow-chip">Employee</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">TimeTrack + Ultima</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">CirrusDCS</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">Workday</span></div><div class="arch-value">Certified. Managed. Protected.</div><a href="workday.html">Explore Workday Solution â†’</a></article><article class="arch-card partner"><h3>Software Partners</h3><div class="arch-tag">Extend employee interactions to your platform.</div><div class="arch-flow"><span class="flow-chip">Employee</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">TimeTrack + Ultima</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">Partner Architecture</span><span class="flow-arrow">â†’</span><span class="flow-chip">WFM / HCM</span></div><div class="arch-value">Build Less. Offer More. Grow Faster.</div><a href="software-partners.html">Explore Partner Technology â†’</a></article></div></div></section>

<section class="tt-final"><div class="wrap"><div class="tt-eyebrow">EVERY PUNCH MATTERS</div><h2>Better Workforce Data<br/>Starts Here.</h2><p>Talk with ZKTeco WFM about your employee workflows, time and labor requirements,<br/>workforce controls and Ultima deployment strategy.</p><div class="tt-btns"><a class="tt-btn light" href="contact.html">Request a Demo â†’</a></div><div class="brand-value">Purpose-Built. Integrated. Scalable.</div></div></section>
</main>
<script is:inline>
  const zohoModal = document.querySelector('[data-zoho-modal]');
  let zohoLastTrigger;
  const closeZohoLeadForm = () => { zohoModal?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true'); document.body.classList.remove('zoho-modal-open'); zohoLastTrigger?.focus(); };
  const openZohoLeadForm = (trigger) => { zohoLastTrigger = trigger; zohoModal?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false'); document.body.classList.add('zoho-modal-open'); zohoModal?.querySelector('#Company')?.focus(); };
  document.querySelector('.tt-final .tt-btn.light[href="contact.html"]')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); openZohoLeadForm(event.currentTarget); });
  zohoModal?.querySelectorAll('[data-zoho-form-close]').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', closeZohoLeadForm));
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (event) => { if (event.key === 'Escape' && zohoModal?.getAttribute('aria-hidden') === 'false') closeZohoLeadForm(); });
  zohoModal?.querySelector('[data-zoho-captcha-reload]')?.addEventListener('click', () => { const captcha = document.getElementById('imgid4421205000000933108'); captcha.src = captcha.src.replace(/&d\d+$/, '') + '&d' + Date.now(); });
  zohoModal?.querySelector('form')?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => { const form = event.currentTarget; if (!form.checkValidity()) { event.preventDefault(); form.reportValidity(); return; } form.querySelector('.formsubmit')?.setAttribute('disabled', 'disabled'); });
  window.checkMandatory4421205000000933108 = () => {
    const form = document.forms.WebToLeads4421205000000933108;
    if (!form?.checkValidity()) { form?.reportValidity(); return false; }
    form.querySelector('.formsubmit')?.setAttribute('disabled', 'disabled');
    return true;
  };
</script>
